# Pinned MISS sets for scripts/check-lane-scheme-controls.sh, by mutant name.
# Made from `bash scripts/check-lane-scheme-controls.sh --discover` and read:
# each set must name the case its mutant is for. An exact set is compared
# whole. ("contains", …) is only for a mutant that breaks BASE: nearly every
# case then fails, so only its BASE rows are pinned (and counted as killed).
# After any case or mutant change, re-run --discover and re-read.
